From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zyang2 <zyang2@zoo-003.maas>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:41:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] lib: leave the application ports out of Mako's spec
 export

The raft-rs, kad and other ports are not part of the Raft spec and no
protocol module uses them. At 1bb2f142 the raft-rs port needs a vstd
specification of HashSet::with_capacity_and_hasher that Verus
0.2026.08.02.b677dd5 (Mako's pinned verifier) lacks, so the whole crate
stops at that port. Without the ports the crate verifies on the pinned
Verus: 1916 verified, 0 errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/lib.rs | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/lib.rs b/src/lib.rs
index 03e54059..e7e097c1 100644
--- a/src/lib.rs
+++ b/src/lib.rs
@@ -25,6 +25,9 @@ mod common;
 mod examples;
 mod generated;
 mod implementation;
+// Mako's spec export leaves out the application ports (raft-rs, kad, ...):
+// the protocol modules do not use them, and they need a newer vstd.
+#[cfg(any())]
 mod ports;
 pub mod protocol;
 mod services;
